<div class="welcome-panel"><div class="welcome-story"><svg class="welcome-compass" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-compass"/></svg><h1>The best part?<br>Figuring it out together.</h1><p>A shared space for the destinations, places, and little possibilities that become a great trip.</p><div class="welcome-points"><span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg>Collect the possibilities</span><span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-people"/></svg>Bring your people</span><span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Find your favorites</span></div></div><section class="welcome-form"><h2>Welcome back, organizer.</h2><p>Sign in to create trips and bring your group together.</p><form method="post" action="/login" class="stack-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label for="username">Username<input id="username" name="username" autocomplete="username" maxlength="120" required autofocus></label><label for="password">Password<input id="password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" maxlength="1024" required></label><button class="button primary full-width">Sign in<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button></form><div class="join-help"><strong>Joining a friend’s trip?</strong><p>Use the private invite link they shared. You’ll only need your name—no account to create.</p></div></section></div>